-- title:
--   Ld Sandwich Line One Point Endpoint Ld Gbcon Lift Of Axis Self
-- statement:
--   **The endpoint relation lifts to every selected slice coordinate.**
--
--   Let `params`, `strategy`, and `family` satisfy the field, axis, self-consistency, and point-consistency hypotheses. For natural numbers $k,i$ with $i<k$, the $i$-th evaluated slice and the right one-point family satisfy
--
--   $$
--   \operatorname{ConsRel}\left(\operatorname{Unif}(\operatorname{SandwichedLineQuestion}(\mathrm{params},k)),\operatorname{evaluatedSlice}_i,\operatorname{ldSandwichLineOnePointRightFamily}(k,i),\zeta+\sqrt{8m\varepsilon+4\delta}\right).
--   $$
--
--   This endpoint estimate supplies the zero-coordinate and nonzero-coordinate branches of `ldSandwichLineOnePoint_core_of_axis_self`.
--
--   Formalization credit: Sirui Lu, Ruixuan Deng, Yanqiao Zhu, and Zhengfeng Ji (arXiv:2609.19814). Mathematical source: Zhengfeng Ji, Anand Natarajan, Thomas Vidick, John Wright, and Henry Yuen (arXiv:2009.12982).
--
